{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":470,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Accelerator_Plush"},"children":["Accelerator Plush"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCg"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Accelerator Plush"]}," is an official Paradoxum Games toy which is currently available to be pre-ordered. It was made by Juniper Creates™. The plushie offers the second version of the Default Level 5 ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Accelerator","title":"Accelerator"},"children":["Accelerator"]}," skin. Anybody who bought the toy would be emailed a code 24 hours later, which allowed them to get the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Accelerator/Gallery#Plushie","title":"Accelerator/Gallery"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Plushie"]}]}]}," skin for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Accelerator","title":"Accelerator"},"children":["Accelerator"]},". This is no longer the case after the 18th of May 2025."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The plasma gun is detachable. It is made out of plush fabric and Polypropylene cotton, it is 7.5 inches long, 8.3 inches tall and 10.6 inches wide, or 19.05 centimetres long, 21.082 centimetres tall and 26.924 centimetres wide. A tree is planted for every order of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Accelerator Plush"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":